:: Last Night Sister [event sister_quest] {"position":"5275,1775","size":"100,100"}
/* Quest "The Last Night" (sister_lastNight), part of The Night Shift (main_nightShift), STAGE1_PROPOSAL.md 6.9. Optional, like
   the rehearsal. She comes out to the car as the hostess, calm and quiet, the way we rehearsed it, and gets into the back
   seat, and sees $mom.callName. They both stop. They know. $mom.callName takes her hand. Neither says a word, and I watch it in
   the rearview mirror. Silence. Advances her line. */
<<silent>><<SetBackground "images/locations/car.jpg">><</silent>>
$mom.callName is already in the back seat when $sister.callName comes out of the house. I told them both to sit in the back, and I didn't tell either of them why.

$sister.callName walks down the driveway in the dress from the rehearsal and the heels she practiced in, with her coat over her arm, calm and quiet, the way we ran it. She opens the rear door on the other side, bends down to get in, and stops.

<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/last_night/backseat.jpg" 600>>
/* The dark back seat of a car, two women in black dresses looking at each other, the dome light on */

The dome light is on. They look at each other across the back seat, both in black, both made up for the same evening, and nobody says anything.

I watch it in the rearview mirror. $sister.callName understands first, I think, why she was told to wear that and sit there, and a second later $mom.callName understands why she was told to look after her. Then I can see them both working out what the other one has been doing all these months, and with whom.

$sister.callName gets in and closes the door very quietly, and the dome light goes out.

In the dark, $mom.callName reaches across the seat and takes her hand, and $sister.callName holds on. They sit like that, looking straight ahead, not at each other and not at me.

I start the car.

<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterCorruption" 3>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterExhibition" 3>>
<<Feel $sister "mom" 2 "lasting">>
<<Feel $mom "sister" 2 "lasting">>
<<NextQuest $sister>>
